<title>CHINA: China cotton acreage seen at 4.79 mln ha in '97.</title>
<headline>China cotton acreage seen at 4.79 mln ha in '97.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>China will plant a total of 4.79 million hectares with cotton in the 1997 season, the Economic Information Daily said on Friday.</p>
<p>Domestic cotton acreage slipped by 660,600 hectares in 1996 to 4.67 million hectares, an earlier report said.</p>
<p>Sluggish sales of cotton have influenced farmers' interest in planting the crop, the newspaper said, but gave no further details.</p>
<p>-- Beijing Newsroom (8610) 6532 1921</p>
